    "detailed_description": "<i>Every 10 seconds, a bomb explodes. <br>Each explosion marks the start of a new round. <br>In each round, traces of the previous bomb remain. <br>In every level, there are Exp10sions!!!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exp10sion, a puzzle platformer:</h2>You will play as a bomb that <strong>explodes within 10 seconds</strong>, managing to reach the Target Door before explosion. <br><br>Each explosion respawns the bomb, starts a new round, and generates a &quot;<strong>Time Shadow</strong>&quot; representing your trail of previous round. <br><br>Skillfully use your shadow and level's mechanisms to overcome numerous obstacles and unravel puzzles, in the cycle of explosions and rebirth!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2>\ud83d\udd52 Tick-Tock Tensions: In &quot;Exp10sion&quot;, time takes center stage. As the clock steadily ticks away, your adorable bomb character faces an explosive fate. Can you unravel time's mysteries at a leisurely pace?<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Pixel Art: Immerse yourself in the enchanting pixelated scenes of &quot;Exp10sion&quot;.  Explore meticulously crafted levels inspired by retro aesthetics, each offering a cozy atmosphere and a touch of nostalgia.<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 Whimsical Puzzles: &quot;Exp10sion&quot; challenges your intellect with a wide array of time-centric puzzles in over 70 levels. Magnets, lasers or even something that can stop the ticking timer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ludum Dare:</h2>The prototype of this game is made during Ludum Dare 51, under the theme of &quot;Every 10 seconds&quot;.",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Every 10 seconds, a bomb explodes. <br>Each explosion marks the start of a new round. <br>In each round, traces of the previous bomb remain. <br>In every level, there are Exp10sions!!!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exp10sion, a puzzle platformer:</h2>You will play as a bomb that <strong>explodes within 10 seconds</strong>, managing to reach the Target Door before explosion. <br><br>Each explosion respawns the bomb, starts a new round, and generates a &quot;<strong>Time Shadow</strong>&quot; representing your trail of previous round. <br><br>Skillfully use your shadow and level's mechanisms to overcome numerous obstacles and unravel puzzles, in the cycle of explosions and rebirth!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2>\ud83d\udd52 Tick-Tock Tensions: In &quot;Exp10sion&quot;, time takes center stage. As the clock steadily ticks away, your adorable bomb character faces an explosive fate. Can you unravel time's mysteries at a leisurely pace?<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Pixel Art: Immerse yourself in the enchanting pixelated scenes of &quot;Exp10sion&quot;.  Explore meticulously crafted levels inspired by retro aesthetics, each offering a cozy atmosphere and a touch of nostalgia.<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 Whimsical Puzzles: &quot;Exp10sion&quot; challenges your intellect with a wide array of time-centric puzzles in over 70 levels. Magnets, lasers or even something that can stop the ticking timer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ludum Dare:</h2>The prototype of this game is made during Ludum Dare 51, under the theme of &quot;Every 10 seconds&quot;.",
